# Twitter Tab Bar — a Twitter-like bottom tab bar (Home/Search/Notifications/Message) that slides away while the Home feed scrolls down and returns on scroll up; the floating compose button spins into a "message" icon on the Message tab.
# What this test covers: scrolling the feed down (bar + FAB hide) and up (they return), the FAB on Home (logs
# 'message') and on Message (spun to the message icon, logs 'default'), every tab, switching tabs while the
# 500 ms FAB spin is mid-flight, a long press on the FAB (highlight spring), scrolling to the end of the feed
# and partway back up.
# expect-log: { item: 'message' }
# expect-log: { item: 'default' }
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/twitter-tab-bar"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait 800
# FAB on Home: edit icon, selects 'message'.
press 354 730
wait 700
# Scroll the feed down: bar and FAB hide.
swipe 200 650 200 250
wait 1200
# Scroll up a little (slow, no fling, never reaching the top: a downward drag on a feed already at its top
# dismisses the whole demo): they come back.
gesture pan 200 300 0 150 600
wait 1000
# Every tab; on Message the FAB spins to the message icon.
press 150 818
wait 600
press 251 818
wait 600
press 352 818
wait 900
press 354 730
wait 700
# Switch tabs while the 500 ms spin is mid-flight, back and forth.
press 75 835
wait 150
press 352 818
wait 150
press 150 818
wait 150
press 352 818
wait 900
# Long press on the FAB: highlight spring, then 'default' on release.
longpress 354 730 1200
wait 800
# Back to Home, scroll to the end and back to the top.
press 75 835
wait 800
swipe 200 740 200 160
wait 300
swipe 200 740 200 160
wait 300
swipe 200 740 200 160
wait 300
swipe 200 740 200 160
wait 1500
gesture pan 200 300 0 400 600
wait 400
gesture pan 200 300 0 400 600
wait 1500
# Rapid tab burst.
press 150 818
press 251 818
press 352 818
press 75 835
wait 1200
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
